TerrainData 2021.x tree -- shipped --trees file for Unity class 156
Location in this distribution: trees/TerrainData-2021.x.json
  (repository only: it is not listed in build.zig.zon `.paths` and is not
  copied into the release tarballs, so it travels with a clone or a source
  archive rather than with the package or a binary release)

The file is Unity's own TerrainData field layout, in this project's
`--trees` JSON format: the Unity 2021.x editor type tree for class 156,
with the base fields a stripped build omits removed and the 36-byte
runtime-only vector region the editor tree does not serialize added back
from observed objects (commit 0619cd4). It is the same kind of artifact as
the builtin_trees database above -- serializer layout metadata, carrying no
Unity code and no game content -- kept as JSON instead of packed into the
binary database because it covers one class of one release.

The editor tree it was derived from is not identified in this tree, and no
distribution terms for it are recorded here. Anyone redistributing the JSON
should confirm them at the origin.
