texture2ddecoder -- block-format decode routines
Location in this distribution: src/texture.zig

No texture2ddecoder source is vendored here. Four of the block decoders in
src/texture.zig are ports or transcriptions of its routines rather than
independent implementations, and each says so at its own definition:

  - BC6H                    ported from bcn.cpp
  - PVRTC                   ported from pvrtc.cpp
  - ATC and EAC             ported from atc.cpp and etc.cpp
  - ETC extraction formulas transcribed from the same decoder

The other formats in that file are implemented from the public format
descriptions and only cross-validated against texture2ddecoder for
byte-exactness. Cross-validation is not derivation and is not covered here.

texture2ddecoder's own distribution terms are not recorded in this tree, nor
is the upstream revision the ports were taken from. Anyone redistributing
src/texture.zig should confirm them at the origin.
